Text data of the Consilia portal
================================

The transcriptions, structured texts, machine translations, keywords and
annotation layers in data/, output/ and site-data/, and the TEI exports made
from them, are released under the

    Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution: Michael Schonhardt (ed.), Consilia. A portal for medieval legal
opinions, https://dekm-tud.github.io/coding-consilia/ (see CITATION.cff; every
TEI file and site-data/manifest.json record the data revision).

The printed sources (Baldus de Ubaldis, Consilia, Venice 1575; Nicolaus de
Tudeschis, Consilia, Venice 1571) are in the public domain. Page images are not
part of this repository; they are served by the holding libraries and the
Internet Archive under their own terms, credited beneath every page.
